---
const services = [
  {
    title: "Custom development",
    text: "Modules, themes, integrations, and workflows.",
  },
  {
    title: "Maintenance and support",
    text: "Security updates, performance, monitoring for live sites.",
  },
  {
    title: "Migration services",
    text: "Upgrades from Drupal 5–11 and other CMS platforms.",
  },
  {
    title: "Architecture and audit",
    text: "Technical reviews and design for large Drupal estates.",
  },
];
---

<section
  id="drupal"
  data-parallax-section
  class="relative overflow-hidden border-b border-border"
>
  <div
    data-parallax-bg
    class="parallax-glow parallax-glow--left"
    aria-hidden="true"
  />

  <div class="relative z-10 mx-auto max-w-6xl px-4 py-16 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 lg:py-20">
    <div class="section-grid">
      <div data-parallax-sticky class="lg:sticky lg:top-24 lg:self-start">
        <span data-parallax-line class="parallax-line" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        <p class="section-label">Drupal</p>
        <h2 class="section-title">Specialist since 2007.</h2>
        <ul class="mt-6 space-y-2 text-sm text-text-secondary">
          <li>Module contributor</li>
          <li>Drupal 8 Blueprints author</li>
          <li>DrupalCamp organiser</li>
        </ul>
        <p class="mt-8 font-mono text-xs leading-relaxed text-text-muted">
          17+ yrs · 100+ projects
        </p>
      </div>

      <div data-parallax-reveal class="space-y-12">
        <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed text-text-secondary">
          Drupal has been central to my work for nearly 20 years — module
          development, migrations, and architecture for busy public-facing
          sites.
        </p>

        <div>
          <h3 class="text-sm font-medium">Services</h3>
          <dl data-parallax-stagger class="mt-5 divide-rows">
            {
              services.map((service) => (
                <div
                  data-parallax-item
                  class="grid gap-1 sm:grid-cols-[10rem_1fr]"
                >
                  <dt class="text-sm text-text-primary">{service.title}</dt>
                  <dd class="text-sm text-text-secondary">{service.text}</dd>
                </div>
              ))
            }
          </dl>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h3 class="text-sm font-medium">Community</h3>
          <ul
            data-parallax-stagger
            class="mt-5 space-y-4 text-sm leading-relaxed text-text-secondary"
          >
            <li data-parallax-item>
              <span class="text-text-primary">DrupalCamp London</span>
              {" — "}organised and led the community's main event (400+ attendees)
            </li>
            <li data-parallax-item>
              <span class="text-text-primary">Contrib modules</span>
              {" — "}15+ modules focused on APIs and performance
            </li>
            <li data-parallax-item>
              <span class="text-text-primary">Drupal CWG</span>
              {" — "}5+ years on community governance
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-x-8 gap-y-3 border-t border-border pt-8">
          <button
            type="button"
            data-open-contact
            class="btn btn-primary link-arrow"
          >
            Discuss a Drupal project
          </button>
          <a
            href="https://www.drupal.org/u/aburrows"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
            class="btn btn-secondary self-center"
          >
            Drupal.org profile
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
